{# goal: Render the zk-ref-open refresh completion report from measured delta counts, license gate, fine.db embedding inventory, seal run IDs, bundle manifest, and live recall probes. Deterministic (no LLM call). #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    revision_label:
      type: string
      non_blank: true
    prior_run_id:
      type: string
      non_blank: true
    final_run_id:
      type: string
      required: false
    delta_summary: object
    license_gate_rc: integer
    inventory_summary: object
    bundle_summary: object
    recall_probes: array
    pre_copy_snapshots: array
    open_failures:
      type: array
      required: false
    convergence_verdict:
      type: string
      non_blank: true
---
## zk-ref-open Sync Report — {{ revision_label }}

- **Convergence verdict (`ZRS-1`):** `{{ convergence_verdict }}`
- **Run lineage:** `{{ prior_run_id }}` → `{{ final_run_id | default("unsealed") }}`
- **Delta counts:** +{{ delta_summary.added | default(0) }} added | ~{{ delta_summary.modified | default(0) }} modified | -{{ delta_summary.contracted | default(0) }} contracted | {{ delta_summary.retained | default(0) }} dual-purpose retained

### Gate Measurements
- **D10 license gate (`zk-ref-license-gate.sh`):** exit `{{ license_gate_rc }}`
- **Embedding inventory (`fine.db`):** `complete={{ inventory_summary.fine_complete | default(false) }}`, `missing={{ inventory_summary.missing | default("unknown") }}`, confirmed model `{{ inventory_summary.confirmed_model | default("unknown") }}`
- **Bundle manifest:** `expected_passage_count={{ bundle_summary.expected_passage_count | default("unknown") }}`, registry commit `{{ bundle_summary.registry_commit | default("uncommitted") }}`, release `{{ bundle_summary.release_status | default("unknown") }}`

### Live Recall Probes ({{ recall_probes | selectattr("passed") | list | length }}/{{ recall_probes | length }} passed)
{% if recall_probes | length == 0 %}
_No probes recorded._
{% else %}
| Query | Expectation | Observed | Passed |
|---|---|---|---|
{% for p in recall_probes %}| {{ p.query | default("") }} | {{ p.expectation | default("") }} | {{ p.observed | default("") }} | {{ p.passed | default(false) }} |
{% endfor %}{% endif %}

### Pre-copy Snapshots ({{ pre_copy_snapshots | length }})
{% for snap in pre_copy_snapshots %}
- `{{ snap }}`
{% endfor %}
{% if open_failures is defined and open_failures | length > 0 %}
### Open Failures ({{ open_failures | length }})
{% for f in open_failures %}
- {{ f }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
